1.6 Hz, 1H), 7.32 - 7.21 (m, 3H), 7.17 (td, J = 7.6, 1.3 Hz, 1H), 2.41
(s, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 165.6, 158.3, 147.3, 141.9, 138.2,
137.8, 133.0, 130.2, 129.3, 128.8, 127.4, 125.5, 123.4, 123.0, 121.9,
