via Pd-catalyzed intramolecular amination of δ -C(sp2)-H bonds (condition
A). A mixture of picolinamide (1.0 mmol, 1.0 eq), Pd(OAc)2 (4.5 mg, 0.02
mmol, 0.02 eq), PhI(OAc)2 (645 mg, 2.0 mmol, 2.0 eq) and toluene (8 mL)
in a 20 mL glass vial (purged with Ar, sealed with PTFE cap) was heated
at 60 °C for 24 hours. The reaction mixture was cooled to rt, and
concentrated in vacuo. The resulting residue was purified by silica gel
flash chromatography to give the cyclized product. Compound 6 was
prepared following the standard procedure C in 94%. Compound 6' was
prepared following the standard procedure C in 4%. 6: 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300
