$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure D: Synthesis of indolines
via Pd-catalyzed intramolecular amination of δ -C(sp2)-H bonds (condition
B). A mixture of picolinamide (1.0 mmol, 1.0 eq), Pd(OAc)2 (1.1 mg, 0.005
mmol, 0.005 eq), PhI(OAc)2 (645 mg, 2.0 mmol, 2.0 eq) and toluene (8 mL)
in a 20 mL glass vial (purged with Ar, sealed with PTFE cap) was heated
at 80 °C for 24 hours. The reaction mixture was cooled to rt, and
concentrated in vacuo. The resulting residue was purified by silica gel
flash chromatography to give the cyclized product. Compound 9 was
prepared following the standard procedure D 87% yield. Compound 9' was
prepared following the standard procedure D in 8% yield. 9: 1H NMR
(CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 8.63 (d, J = 4.5 Hz, 1H), 8.27 (d, J = 6.9 Hz, 1H),
7.87-7.83 (m, 2H), 7.40 (m, 1H), 7.23-7.14 (m, 2H), 4.42 (t, J = 8.0 Hz,
2H), 3.16 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75.5 MHz) δ 166.28,
154.00, 148.00, 144.32, 137.10, 132.74, 129.08, 127.01, 125.20, 124.24,
119.27, 116.59, 49.94, 30.11; HRMS Calcd for C14H12BrN2O [M+H+]:
303.0128; Found: 303.0134. 9': 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 8.54 (d, J = 4.4
Hz, 1H), 8.21 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 2H), 7.87 (td, J = 7.7, 1.3 Hz, 1H), 7.47
(d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.44 (m, 1H), 7.15 (t, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H), 7.04 (d, J =
8.1 Hz, 1H), 3.67 (q, J = 7.0 Hz, 2H), 3.10 (t, J = 7.6 Hz, 2H), 2.36 (s,
3H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75.5 MHz) δ 169.66, 164.69, 150.25, 150.10, 148.19,
137.44, 131.37, 130.65, 128.56, 126.26, 125.73, 122.19, 122.14, 38.46,
30.69, 21.01; HRMS Calcd for C16H16BrN2O3 [M+H+]: 363.0339; Found:
363.0347.
