2-Amino-1-(2,2,3,3-tetrafluoropropoxy)-3,5-dinitro- and
4-Amino-1-(2,2,3,3-tetrafluoropropoxy)-3,5-dinitrobenzenes (2/3c), yield
87% 2c: mp 164-165 °C; 1H NMR (acetoned6) δ 4.98 (tt, 3J = 12.4 Hz, 4J =
1.4 Hz, 2H), 6.73 (tt, 2J = 52.3 Hz, 3J = 5.4 Hz, 1H), 7.82 (br s, 2H),
8.02 and 8.72 (d, 4J = 2.7 Hz, 2H); 19F NMR (acetone-d6) δ 59.7 (ddt,
2JHF = 53.3 Hz, 3JFF = 4.9 Hz, 3JHF = 1.3 Hz), 45.10 (ttd, 3JHF = 12.4
Hz, 3JHF = 5.5 Hz, 3JFF = 4.9 Hz); 13C NMR (DMSO-d6) δ 66.12 (qt, 1JCH =
151.1 Hz, 2JCF = 34.9 Hz), 108.9 (dtt, 1J = 215.1 Hz, 1J = 247.1 Hz, 2J =
