(dd, J = 5.8 Hz, J = 4.4 Hz), 145.51 (m, J = 5.8 Hz, J = 4.4 Hz). 3c: 1H
NMR (acetone-d6) δ 5.01 (tt, 3J = 12.4 Hz, 4J = 1.4 Hz, 2H), 6.63 (tt, 2J
= 52.3 Hz, 3J = 5.4 Hz, 1H), 7.95 (s, 2H). Anal. Calcd for C9H7F4N3O5: C,
34.52; H, 2.25; N, 13.42. Found: C, 34.58; H, 2.21; N, 13.47.
