$DATUM V-3-2 Conversion of Ru-Catalyzed C-N Bond Forming Amidation Reaction
(Scheme 6b) To an oven-dried screw capped vial equipped with a spinvane
triangular-shaped Teflon stirbar were added 2-phenylpydine (1a, 14.3 µL,
0.1 mmol), 4-methylbenzoyl azide (2b, 25.2 µL, 0.18 mmol),
[RuCl2(p-cymene)]2 (3.1 mg, 5 mol %), AgSbF6 (6.9 mg, 20 mol %),
2-nitrobenzoic acid (5.0 mg, 30 mol %) and 1,2-dichloroethane (0.5 mL)
under atmospheric conditions. The reaction mixture was stirred in a
pre-heated oil bath at the indicated temperature for 1 h. The reaction
was cooled to room temperature, filtered through a pad of celite and then
washed with CH2Cl2 (10 mL x 3). The solvents were removed under reduced
pressure. 1H NMR yield of the products 3b and 4b were determined by
integration using 1,1,2,2-tetrachloroethane as an internal standard.
5-Methyl-N-phenyl-2-(pyridin-2-yl)benzamide (3b)
N-[5-Methyl-2-(pyridin-2-yl)phenyl]benzamide (4b) 3b: m.p. 162-163 °C; 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.00 (s, 1H), 8.57 (d, J = 4.3 Hz, 1H), 7.70 (td,
J = 7.7, 1.8 Hz, 1H), 7.57 (d, J = 1.0 Hz, 1H), 7.47 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H),
7.43 (d, J = 7.7 Hz, 2H), 7.37 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 7.31 – 7.17 (m, 4H),
7.04 (td, J = 7.3, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 2.38 (s, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ
167.8, 158.4, 148.7, 138.8, 138.3, 136.9, 136.1, 135.4, 131.0, 130.2,
130.0, 128.8, 124.2, 124.1, 122.4, 120.0, 21.1; IR (cm-1) 3168, 3025,
1659, 1592, 1541, 1466, 1318, 1256, 1202, 840; HRMS (FAB+) m/z calcd. for
C19H16N2O [M+H]+: 289.1341, found: 289.1339. 4b: m.p. 100-101 °C; 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 13.42 (s, 1H), 8.67 (dd, J = 1.7, 0.9 Hz, 1H), 8.62
(ddd, J = 4.9, 1.8, 1.0 Hz, 1H), 8.04 (dd, J = 7.8, 1.8 Hz, 2H), 7.83 -
7.71 (m, 2H), 7.61 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.55 - 7.44 (m, 3H), 7.22 (ddd, J
= 7.1, 4.9, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 6.99 (ddd, J = 7.9, 1.8, 0.8 Hz, 1H), 2.44 (s,
3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 165.5, 158.4, 147.1, 140.7, 138.1, 137.7,
135.9, 131.5, 128.6, 128.6, 127.4, 124.4, 122.7, 122.6, 122.2, 121.6,
21.7; IR (cm-1) 2916, 2853, 1665, 1579, 1534, 1469, 1414, 1281, 785, 680;
HRMS (EI+) m/z calcd. for C19H16N2O [M]+: 288.1263, found: 288.1260.
